    <section class="section-padding bg-white">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 mt-5">
            <!-- General Questions -->
            <div class="mb-12">
                <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-8 fade-in">General Questions</h2>
                <div class="space-y-1">
                    <div class="faq-item stagger-item">
                        <div class="faq-question">
                            <span class="text-lg font-medium">What is UPIExpress?</span>
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-icon"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-answer text-gray-600">
                            <p>UPIExpress is a dynamic UPI QR code generation service that allows businesses to accept payments directly to their bank accounts. We generate unique, time-sensitive QR codes with pre-filled amounts for secure transactions.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item stagger-item">
                        <div class="faq-question">
                            <span class="text-lg font-medium">How does the dynamic QR code work?</span>
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-icon"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-answer text-gray-600">
                            <p>When a customer initiates a payment, our system generates a unique QR code with the exact amount pre-filled. The customer scans this code with any UPI app, confirms the amount, and completes the payment. Each QR code is valid for a limited time and can only be used once.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item stagger-item">
                        <div class="faq-question">
                            <span class="text-lg font-medium">Are there any transaction fees?</span>
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-icon"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-answer text-gray-600">
                            <p>No, UPIExpress charges <strong>0% transaction fees</strong>. You only pay our subscription fee based on your chosen plan. All payments go directly to your bank account without any intermediate charges.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Integration & Technical -->
            <div class="mb-12">
                <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-8 fade-in">Integration & Technical</h2>
                <div class="space-y-1">
                    <div class="faq-item stagger-item">
                        <div class="faq-question">
                            <span class="text-lg font-medium">How do I integrate UPIExpress?</span>
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-icon"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-answer text-gray-600">
                            <p>Integration is simple with our REST API. You can generate QR codes by making a POST request to our endpoint and display the QR image to your customers. We also provide webhooks for real-time payment notifications.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item stagger-item">
                        <div class="faq-question">
                            <span class="text-lg font-medium">What webhook data do you send?</span>
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-icon"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-answer text-gray-600">
                            <p>We send comprehensive webhook payloads with all transaction details. Here's an example of the JSON payload:</p>
                            <div class="code-block">
                                <pre><code>{
  <span class="json-key">"id"</span>: <span class="json-number">66</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"amount"</span>: <span class="json-number">100</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"convenience_fee"</span>: <span class="json-number">0</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"total_amount"</span>: <span class="json-number">100</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"txn_id"</span>: <span class="json-string">"UPIEX50004120220115144330001"</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"orderid"</span>: <span class="json-number">500041</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"client_txn_id"</span>: <span class="json-string">"abcd1234"</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"customer_name"</span>: <span class="json-string">"Jon Doe"</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"customer_email"</span>: <span class="json-string">"jondoe@gmail.com"</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"customer_mobile"</span>: <span class="json-string">"9876543210"</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"upi_tn_id"</span>: <span class="json-string">"209876543210"</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"status"</span>: <span class="json-string">"success"</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"note"</span>: <span class="json-string">"Product information"</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"udf1"</span>: <span class="json-string">""</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"udf2"</span>: <span class="json-string">""</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"udf3"</span>: <span class="json-string">""</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"redirect_url"</span>: <span class="json-string">"https://upiexpress.com"</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"webhook_url"</span>: <span class="json-string">"https://upiexpress.com"</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"txnAt"</span>: <span class="json-string">"2022-01-15"</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"createdAt"</span>: <span class="json-string">"2022-01-15T14:43:30.000Z"</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"MerchantId"</span>: <span class="json-string">"AB12s87d6f5g4h3j2k11Øm9n8o7p6q5r4"</span>,
  <span class="json-key">"upi_txn_id"</span>: <span class="json-string">"(merchant app txn id or UTR number if payment is success)"</span>
}</code></pre>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item stagger-item">
                        <div class="faq-question">
                            <span class="text-lg font-medium">What status values can I expect?</span>
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-icon"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-answer text-gray-600">
                            <p>The status field in webhook can have these values:</p>
                            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-2">
                                <li><strong>"success"</strong> - Payment completed successfully</li>
                                <li><strong>"failed"</strong> - Payment failed</li>
                                <li><strong>"pending"</strong> - Payment initiated but not completed</li>
                                <li><strong>"expired"</strong> - QR code expired before payment</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item stagger-item">
                        <div class="faq-question">
                            <span class="text-lg font-medium">How long is a QR code valid?</span>
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-icon"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-answer text-gray-600">
                            <p>Dynamic QR codes are valid for 10 minutes. After this period, the code expires and a new one must be generated for the transaction.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
